# Convex deployment the dashboard talks to. `npx convex dev` in packages/backend
# prints this and writes it to packages/backend/.env.local — copy it here.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is correct and required: the browser opens the reactive
# subscription itself, so this URL ships in the client bundle by design.
#
# ⚠️ Because it is public and there is no auth layer yet, anyone who reads the
# bundle can call the `enqueue` mutation and spend your Anthropic credits. The
# only brake today is the queue-depth cap in packages/backend/convex/jobs.ts.
# Adding auth closes this properly.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONVEX_URL=""

# NOTE: PLAYGROUND_API_URL and PLAYGROUND_API_TOKEN are gone. The dashboard no
# longer proxies to the playground over HTTP — it enqueues into Convex, and a
# worker picks the job up. app/api/generate/route.ts was deleted with them.
